<Legal title="Terms of Service" description="The terms that apply when you use Ventrix by Ventrix.">
<p>These terms are an agreement between <strong>Ventrix</strong> (“we”, “us”), and the organization that signs up for {SITE.product} (“you”, “the Customer”). By creating an account or using the service you agree to them. If you accept on behalf of an organization, you confirm you have authority to do so.</p>

<h2>1. The service</h2>
<p>{SITE.product} is a web application for tracking tools, equipment and stock. We may improve, change or remove features over time, and we’ll try to give notice of changes that significantly reduce what you can do.</p>

<h2>2. Accounts</h2>
<ul>
<li>You must give accurate information and keep sign-in details and PINs confidential.</li>
<li>You are responsible for what happens under your organization’s accounts, including the roles you assign.</li>
<li>Tell us promptly if you think an account has been compromised.</li>
</ul>

<h2>3. Acceptable use</h2>
<p>You won’t: break the law using the service; upload content you have no right to upload or that is harmful or malicious; try to access other customers’ data or to disrupt or probe the service; resell the service without our written consent; or use it to store data it isn’t designed for, such as payment card numbers.</p>

<h2>4. Fees and payment</h2>
<ul>
<li>The price is <strong>{naira(SITE.price.amount)} per {SITE.price.period}</strong> per organization, unless we agree something different in writing. Prices are in Nigerian naira.</li>
