<p>We work to keep the service available and to fix problems quickly, but we don’t promise it will be uninterrupted or error free. Offline mode is a convenience: please check that your queued actions have synced. Support is by email at <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email.support}`}>{SITE.email.support}</a>.</p>

<h2>8. Ending the agreement</h2>
<p>You can cancel at any time; access continues to the end of the paid period. We can suspend or end your access if you seriously or repeatedly break these terms, or if we must by law, and we’ll tell you why where we can. After the agreement ends we’ll delete your data as described in the Privacy Policy.</p>

